@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Send with only "to" and "body" (as in the specification) -> default provider Mock
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "0501234567",
  "body": "Hello, your schedule has been updated."
}

### Send Hebrew text via the Secondary provider
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "+972521234567",
  "body": "שלום, לוח הזמנים שלך עודכן.",
  "provider": "Secondary"
}

### Simulated provider failure (numbers ending in 0000) -> 201 with status Failed
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "0500000000",
  "body": "This one fails at the provider.",
  "provider": "Mock"
}

### Validation error -> 400 RFC 7807 problem details
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "12345",
  "body": "",
  "provider": "Twilio"
}

### List all messages (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages

### List sent messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages?status=Sent

### Get one message (replace the id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
